<p>
  My engineering practice is grounded in hands-on metal fabrication—manual and CNC milling, lathe operations, precision sheet-metal forming, and extensive 3D printing across FDM, SLS nylon, and composite resins. In industry, I have developed high-rate automated assembly tooling at <strong>Broan-NuTone</strong>, designed dynamic drone propulsion test stands at <strong>VEX Robotics</strong>, and deployed autonomous mobile transport robotics at <strong>GE Appliances</strong>.
</p>

